FADE IN:

INT. EMPTY ROOM - DAY

A bare room. A single window. Late autumn light.

PROTAGONIST (30s, sharp eyes, worn jacket) stands at the window, back to us.

PROTAGONIST
(to no one in particular)
Every story starts with a question.

Beat.

PROTAGONIST (CONT'D)
This one starts with two.

She turns. Faces us.

PROTAGONIST (CONT'D)
Who are you? And what do you want?

She crosses toward camera, stops.

PROTAGONIST (CONT'D)
Those are never the same question.

SMASH CUT TO:

EXT. CITY STREET - DAY

The city moves. She walks with it.

